Only produces MUs if they are ordered by a Store with activated setting Supermarket or with the method
orderParts for the setting MU Selection > Order Controlled.
Remarks
Automatic Routing of the produced part delivers it to the ordering station. If automatic routing of the
part is deactivated, Plant Simulation automatically activates it.
The Source produces MUs according to the setting Interval Adjustable and the Interval between the
creation times, that you type in.
